<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 83 FOR 2 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 83 FOR 2 AT LUNCH V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, needing 426 to win, were 83 for two wickets at lunch on the final day of the second and last test against Sri Lanka at Colombo on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 331 and 386 for 4 declared; Pakistan 292 and 83 for 2.</p>
